abstract: >
  Reproducible audit of claims linking late-medieval convex spectacles
  to scholar career extension and knowledge growth. Four-layer verdict
  (v4): modern mechanism supported; medieval near-work use credible;
  macro unlock unsupported; wearer-year effect unidentified (hunt panel).
